 authorities.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunway Property to preview Sunway Velocity 3 this month - Sunway Property (https://sunwayproperty.com/news-events/sunway-property-to-preview-sunway-velocity-3-this-month/)\nciteturn271search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2.5 years ago; Crawled: 2 weeks ago; Sunway Property, the property arm of Sunway Bhd, will hold a preview of the RM1.8 billion Sunway Velocity 3 by the end of this month. ... While details for Plot B are yet to be determined, Sunway Velocity 3 is scheduled for completion by the end of 2028.\n\n  * 18 Apr, 2024\n  * The Edge\n\nSunway Property to preview Sunway Velocity 3 this month\n\nImage\n\nSunway Property, the property arm of Sunway Bhd, will hold a preview of the RM1.8 billion Sunway Velocity 3 by the end of this month.\n\nThe project, which is the latest phase in the integrated development of Sunway Velocity Kuala Lumpur, will be a serviced residence with co-living-ready features. It is divided into two plots — Plot A (3.43 acres) will consist of two 61-storey serviced residence blocks (Towers A and B) while Plot B (2.07 acres) will have a single serviced residence tower (Tower C).\n\nAccording to Sunway Property chief executive officer (central and northern region and SPFM) Chong Sau Min, the integrated development of Sunway Velocity Kuala Lumpur is inspired by Sunway’s flagship township Sunway City Kuala Lumpur, which features different components such as residential, retail, mall, office, healthcare and education.\n\nSunway Velocity Kuala Lumpur has direct links to Maluri MRT and LRT interchange stations, which are a short distance away from the Tun Razak Exchange financial hub, Malaysia’s international business and financial district. \nHe adds that the development incorporates elderly-, child- and wheelchair-friendly design, with features such as stepless transition at the foyer, living and bathroom areas. All bedrooms face outwards for plenty of natural lighting and ventilation.\n\nWhile details for Plot B are yet to be determined, Sunway Velocity 3 is scheduled for completion by the end of 2028.\n\nImage\n\nSunway Velocity update\n\nTo recap, some 75% of Sunway Velocity — the first phase of Sunway Velocity Kuala Lumpur — are commercial components. They comprise a one million sq ft shopping mall, medical centre, hotel, purpose-built office buildings, stratified office suites, retail lots and serviced apartments. The mall is fully tenanted and the residential units are fully sold.\n\nMeanwhile, Sunway Velocity TWO, which is connected to Sunway Velocity via a link bridge, is 79% residential with four residential towers. Towers A, B, C and D are fully sold, and the recently completed retail units have achieved a 100% tenancy rate.\n\nImageAn artist’s impression of the children’s room in Sunway Velocity 3\n\n“Complementing these developments, Sunway Velocity 3 is a residential development offering a comparatively more affordable starting price point that ensures its appeal to a wider audience. Sunway Velocity 3 is also the first in the township to offer co-living-ready features,” Chong says.\n\n“Given the warm reception that we have received for both previous developments due to the good return on investment and the well-planned facilities, as well as buyers’ feedback that they have great confidence in the developments as they are all owned and managed by Sunway, we are confident that Sunway Velocity 3 will be well-received.”\n\nImageCo-working and reading space at the development--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHIGH-RISE\n\nEdgeProp.my  \nFEBRUARY 21, 2025  \n13\n\nT (https://media.edgeprop.my/s3fs-public/special_report_2025/feb/report/200225-New-launches-Bumper-issue-KL-Selangor.pdf)\nciteturn271search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.6 years ago; <tr><td>Sunway Velocity 3</td><td>Sunway Velocity Three Sdn Bhd</td><td>2028</td><td>1,604</td><td>Serviced a